OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and bright morning with
OL,6,Fsunny intervals but increasing areas
OL,7,Fof cloud. Then a dry afternoon with
OL,8,Fsunny intervals turning increasingly
OL,9,Fhazier later on.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry and bright, though
OL,12,Flargely cloudy evening. Cloud will
OL,13,Fcontinue to thicken overnight, with a
OL,14,Ffew outbreaks of rain developing
OL,15,Ftowards dawn.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,18,Fspreading northwards, some of which
OL,19,Fwill likely be heavy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
